== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|a+}} [[Booster Pack #5]] added an electrical graphical effect to Charged Keys.
** {{dlc|r}} Charged Keys start sparkling as soon as they spawn, helping players distinguish them from normal keys and prevent wasting charges.
* Charged Keys may be based off of the story of Benjamin Franklin discovering electricity via tying a key to a kite during a lighting storm, thus drawing an electrical charge from it.
* Golden Keys having a skull on them is a reference to a [[wikipedia:skeleton key|skeleton key]], a master key that is used to unlock multiple doors.
** {{i|Skeleton Key}} is also an item.

